    {
      "uid": "zhcn:372cb9ee7a314b42a3f657e4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“虽然各有不同，看起来都很好吃！”\n相扑火锅大会在温馨的气氛下闭幕了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21eb7c2d2fb496a08bdca8de199f6ec2a2c3b9af028fb9dbd733f0e66936058a",
