      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "几天后──“我会好好守护自己的口味，\n大家也要好好守护属于自己的口味喔～☆”",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7ec5e892016f75dd157afa62bc208ca1b542b5e2dd6c1ec56c063608f102d76",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
